    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Stream or Scream?</strong> \ud83d\udc7b</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a fearless streamer\u2014always hidden behind a horse mask\u2014as you explore Japan\u2019s most haunted ruins in <strong>HAUNTED STREAMER</strong>, a single-player horror experience where every eerie moment is broadcast live.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you earn fame and fortune, or become just another missing person?<br>It's time to start your live stream.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Capture the Terror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghosts, vengeful spirits, and poltergeist activity lurk in the darkness.<br>Your job? <strong>Film everything.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The closer and longer you capture high-value footage, the more viewers you\u2019ll attract.<br>Earn <strong>Likes</strong> and <strong>Super Coins</strong> by delivering the most chilling content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware\u2014some things are best left unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/1a920c0809dd1181f1f9af3c39444eb1.poster.avif?t=1751685059\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/1a920c0809dd1181f1f9af3c39444eb1.webm?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/1a920c0809dd1181f1f9af3c39444eb1.mp4?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sanity vs. Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the more horrifying the encounters become.<br>Your sanity won\u2019t last forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Witnessing too many paranormal events will break your mind.<br>If your sanity drops to zero\u2026 death awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go for the perfect shot?<br>Can you balance fear and fame, or will the madness consume you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/f6a63d0b11c24aa4c45ca9b0036c114b.poster.avif?t=1751685059\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/f6a63d0b11c24aa4c45ca9b0036c114b.webm?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/f6a63d0b11c24aa4c45ca9b0036c114b.mp4?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Super Coin Challenges</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your audience craves danger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Viewers will send real-time challenges during your stream.<br>Complete them for massive donations\u2014but at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some dares are harmless. Others\u2026 might be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/15d4f37d56ac616a689aebfd1e85d5d0.poster.avif?t=1751685059\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/15d4f37d56ac616a689aebfd1e85d5d0.webm?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234690/extras/15d4f37d56ac616a689aebfd1e85d5d0.mp4?t=1751685059\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Live Streaming and Content Creation Policy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are welcome to stream and create monetized content using this game.</p>",
